{
  "name": "Trance Gate",
  "description": "Continuous stereo Trance Gate. CH16 CC24 sets target amplitude linearly: CC/127; 127 = unity, 0 = silence after release. A shared audio-rate exponential envelope smooths all target changes, including intermediate levels. Attack and Release are half-times in milliseconds (defaults 5/10 ms), not full ramp durations. Starts with a closed envelope; reads existing shared CC state without resetting it. Use as a mixer insert with a controller sequencer: CH16, CC24, Step, Reset Value 0. Restart the rack after changing performance controllers. Multiple instances share CC24.",
